# PostHog Privacy And Deployment

- Preserve the documented Cloud versus self-hosted decision model unless there is a deliberate architecture change.
- Analytics configuration must remain privacy-aware, especially around IP capture, personal data, and tenant segmentation.
- Keep tenant attribution compatible with the shared analytics strategy for this repo.
- Do not assume self-hosted infrastructure behavior unless the deployment target is explicitly changed.
- Changes to analytics infrastructure should respect GDPR and data-residency requirements already documented in the repo.
